@startuml
title AI completion | reference and planned boundaries
hide footbox
participant "Caller" as P0
participant "H09" as P1
participant "Provider" as P2
P0 -> P1: begin -> Waiting
P1 -> P2: start(ID)
P2 -> P1: complete(wrong ID): rejected
P0 -> P1: tick(start + 30000 ms)
P1 -> P2: cancel(ID); state = Failed
P2 -> P1: late complete(ID): rejected
P0 -> P1: new begin -> different ID
note over P0: Scenarios include alternatives; read the v2.0 sequence guide for guards.
@enduml
